{
  "id": "624",
  "title": "I Got The Hiccups",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-12-30",
  "synopsis": "Lili gets a bad case of the hiccups just before meeting He Jing.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/904/8c3c30e06596b121f0cf0ab27c51c35a9147fb35.mp3?1542029710",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我打嗝了\n\n丽丽：（打嗝声）我打嗝了！可何京就要来了！\n保罗：我知道你喜欢何京，先别着急。\n丽丽：我不应该吃那么快的。\n保罗：而且你还喝了一大瓶可乐！\n丽丽：天啊！我这是在干什么！怎么办？\n保罗：嗯……我打嗝的时候我妈经常吓我。\n丽丽：我不想被吓，还有其他方法吗？\n保罗：有！看，何京来了！\n丽丽：天哪！在哪？我没看见他！\n保罗：哈哈！看，你不打嗝了吧？",
    "traditional": "我打嗝了\n\n麗麗：（打嗝聲）我打嗝了！可何京就要來了！\n保羅：我知道你喜歡何京，先別著急。\n麗麗：我不應該吃那麼快的。\n保羅：而且你還喝了一大瓶可樂！\n麗麗：天啊！我這是在幹什麼！怎麼辦？\n保羅：嗯……我打嗝的時候我媽經常嚇我。\n麗麗：我不想被嚇，還有其他方法嗎？\n保羅：有！看，何京來了！\n麗麗：天哪！在哪？我沒看見他！\n保羅：哈哈！看，你不打嗝了吧？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Got The Hiccups"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：（打嗝声）我打嗝了！可何京就要来了！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：（打嗝聲）我打嗝了！可何京就要來了！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì 1 wǒ dǎ gé le kě hé jīng jiù yào lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: (Hiccup sound) I got the hiccups! But He Jing is just about to arrive!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：我知道你喜欢何京，先别着急。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我知道你喜歡何京，先別著急。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ zhī dào nǐ xǐ huan hé jīng xiān bié zháo jí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I know you like He Jing. First, relax."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我不应该吃那么快的。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我不應該吃那麼快的。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ bù yīng gāi chī nà me kuài de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I shouldn’t have eaten so fast."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：而且你还喝了一大瓶可乐！",
      "traditional": "保羅：而且你還喝了一大瓶可樂！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó ér qiě nǐ hái hē le yí dà píng kě lè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: And you also drank a big bottle of coca-cola!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：天啊！我这是在干什么！怎么办？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：天啊！我這是在幹什麼！怎麼辦？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tiān a wǒ zhè shì zài gàn shén me zěn me bàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Heavens! What am I doing! What should I do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：嗯……我打嗝的时候我妈经常吓我。",
      "traditional": "保羅：嗯……我打嗝的時候我媽經常嚇我。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó èn wǒ dǎ gé de shí hou wǒ mā jīng cháng xià wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Hmm… When I have the hiccups, my mom always scares me."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我不想被吓，还有其他方法吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我不想被嚇，還有其他方法嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ bù xiǎng bèi xià hái yǒu qí tā fāng fǎ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I don’t want to be scared. Are there any other methods?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "保罗：有！看，何京来了！",
      "traditional": "保羅：有！看，何京來了！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó yǒu kàn hé jīng lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: There are! Look, He Jing is here!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "丽丽：天哪！在哪？我没看见他！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：天哪！在哪？我沒看見他！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tiān na zài nǎ wǒ méi kàn jiàn tā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Heavens! Where? I don’t see him!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "保罗：哈哈！看，你不打嗝了吧？",
      "traditional": "保羅：哈哈！看，你不打嗝了吧？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hā hā kàn nǐ bù dǎ gé le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Haha! Look, you don’t have the hiccups anymore, right?"
    }
  ],
